# Format staged source files with Prettier (lint-staged replacement;
# the system git predates lint-staged's minimum version).
# `|| true`: husky runs hooks under `sh -e`, and grep exits 1 when it matches
# nothing — so without this a docs-only commit aborts before it starts.
files=$(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=ACMR | grep -E '\.(ts|tsx|css|json|mjs)$' | grep -v -E '^(package-lock\.json|tests/roundtrip/fixtures/)' || true)
if [ -n "$files" ]; then
  npx prettier --write $files --ignore-unknown
  git add $files
fi
